WEBVTT

00:01:39.650 --> 00:01:40.490
<i>Please get off!</i>

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:58.720
<i>I've fallen in love with the same person as</i>

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:04.080
<i>my precious friend...</i>

00:02:05.290 --> 00:02:08.100
You might feel better 
if you drink some water.

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:09.920
Thanks.

00:02:12.390 --> 00:02:13.570
I-I'll pay you back.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:15.940
Oh, don't worry about that.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:18.100
Thanks.

00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:29.070
<i>I don't actually feel sick at all, but...</i>

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:31.360
<i>I couldn't say that.</i>

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:34.250
Yoshioka.

00:02:34.250 --> 00:02:34.960
Huh?

00:02:35.320 --> 00:02:37.420
Give me the water.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:38.550
Eh?!

00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.010
Don't say "eh."

00:02:41.270 --> 00:02:43.430
I bought it, after all.

00:02:44.310 --> 00:02:45.640
I'm gonna drink it, too.

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:48.930
<i>So, that would make this...</i>

00:02:48.930 --> 00:02:49.890
<b>IN</b>

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:49.890
An in...

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:52.020
<b>DIRECT</b>

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:52.020
direct...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.270
ki...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.270
<b>KI</b>

00:02:55.770 --> 00:02:56.000
<b>INDIRECT KI</b>

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:56.800
<b>INDIRECT KI .</b>

00:02:56.800 --> 00:02:57.760
<b>INDIRECT KI . .</b>

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.240
<b>INDIRECT KI . . .</b>

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:01.150
What is it?

00:03:01.150 --> 00:03:04.300
Oh... well... um...

00:03:04.300 --> 00:03:07.660
You don't like this kind of thing?
 Are you a neat freak?

00:03:08.400 --> 00:03:12.100
N-No... it's not that...

00:03:12.100 --> 00:03:14.500
<i>I accidentally started staring.</i>

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.090
I get it.

00:03:21.700 --> 00:03:23.480
Cold! I'm choking!

00:03:24.680 --> 00:03:27.230
You okay?! I've got a towel...

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:41.070
S-Sorry. It looks like I left my towel… 
in the classroom…

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.450
It's fine.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:47.060
<i>I never thought the day would 
come when I'd grow ashamed</i>

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.430
<i>of the sloppy character 
I created for myself.</i>

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:56.980
But everyone puts on nice clothes and

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:59.050
makeup to look good for other people, right?

00:03:59.870 --> 00:04:02.730
So I wonder, what's the difference

00:04:02.730 --> 00:04:06.490
between that and me wanting 
boys to think I'm cute?

00:04:09.780 --> 00:04:15.770
<i>I really get what she meant 
right now. I sure do...</i>

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:16.930
<i>So...</i>

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:19.920
<i>What's wrong with me? Am I a little girl?</i>

00:04:19.090 --> 00:04:19.920
<b>little girl</b>

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:20.700
Self-berating to maintain composure

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:22.530
<i>Am I pretending to be a sloppy 
character with her bag in disarray?</i>

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:21.090
<b>disarray</b>

00:04:21.090 --> 00:04:21.960
<b>Sloppy</b>

00:04:21.170 --> 00:04:21.920
Self-berating to maintain composure

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:24.100
<i>I'm gross! I'm so gross!</i>

00:04:22.550 --> 00:04:23.490
Self-berating to maintain composure

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.490
<b>Gross!
 I'm so gross!</b>

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:25.470
What's wrong?

00:04:26.460 --> 00:04:28.070
Still don't feel well?

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:30.200
No, I'm fine now.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:34.620
Really?

00:04:36.100 --> 00:04:37.560
Really.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:54.150
Oh?

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:59.020
Are you wearing perfume or something?

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:03.110
Huh? No, I'm not...

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:04.600
Oh?

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:06.000
Must be your shampoo.

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:12.540
Strange. It's attractive.

00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:21.870
No reaction?

00:05:26.540 --> 00:05:29.360
That's the part where you 
object or something.

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:31.260
If you don't, I'm just a pervert.

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:37.700
Th-Then you should say it in a way that 
makes it clearer that you're joking!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:40.090
I just didn't know how to react.

00:05:40.090 --> 00:05:42.730
Darn it. Jeez...

00:05:44.680 --> 00:05:48.190
<i>It's the cheapest shampoo 
in the supermarket!</i>

00:05:48.190 --> 00:05:53.340
<i>Even if it was a joke, I wish 
I had used something better.</i>

00:05:53.340 --> 00:05:56.660
<i>Young girls in love don't 
have that kind of freedom.</i>

00:05:57.070 --> 00:05:58.590
Oh, speaking of which.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:05:59.660
What?

00:05:59.660 --> 00:06:03.480
I just remembered, I was supposed 
to buy shampoo on the way home.

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:06.330
Well, good thing 
I helped you remember.

00:06:07.530 --> 00:06:10.840
Shuuei Line - Sakigatani Station

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.840
I'm going to stop by the drug store, so...

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:14.670
Are you sure you're feeling okay now?

00:06:14.670 --> 00:06:16.310
I'm fine! Fine!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:18.800
Okay. So long.

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:27.410
<i>The truth is, I really wanted to 
walk home with Kou, but...</i>

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:32.030
<i>I guess I feel a little shy...</i>

00:06:33.190 --> 00:06:36.500
<i>I feel kind of like 
I'd be doing wrong by Yuuri...</i>

00:06:39.350 --> 00:06:40.330
<i>I'm going to...</i>

00:06:42.480 --> 00:06:44.350
<i>...come clean with Yuuri.</i>

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.170
<i>That I like Kou, too.</i>

00:06:47.770 --> 00:06:48.810
<i>I'm going to come clean.</i>

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:57.080
<i>When you're in love, you start to 
worry about the most trivial details.</i>

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.120
<i>It should feel really restrictive,</i>

00:07:00.120 --> 00:07:04.980
<i>but worrying about this kind of thing 
makes me really happy instead.</i>

00:07:05.320 --> 00:07:06.940
I'm sorry for the wait.

00:07:07.640 --> 00:07:08.980
Do you have a point card?

00:07:08.980 --> 00:07:09.900
No.

00:07:09.900 --> 00:07:11.230
Here, I'll take that.

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:12.360
<b>Special Campaign</b>

00:07:11.230 --> 00:07:12.360
Is that...?

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:21.980
You gave me 3,000 yen...

00:07:23.630 --> 00:07:27.190
<i>I have to come clean with Yuuri soon.</i>

00:07:27.580 --> 00:07:29.580
Thank you for your patronage.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:37.750
<i>I wonder what Yuuri will say.</i>

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:40.370
<i>Maybe she'll hate me?</i>

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.330
<i>But... I'm sure Yuuri would...</i>

00:07:42.330 --> 00:07:43.210
Futaba?

00:07:51.360 --> 00:07:52.950
Yumi-chan?

00:07:55.070 --> 00:07:59.380
Rock-paper-scissors! Rock-paper-scissors!

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:02.090
Hey, Naito! What are you doing?

00:08:04.650 --> 00:08:07.880
<i>Yumi-chan was in my class in middle school.</i>

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.720
<i>She was precious to me back then.</i>

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:15.180
We're choosing teams for cops and robbers.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.240
Hey, let's go!

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:18.620
R-Right.

00:08:19.660 --> 00:08:25.280
<i>Yumi-chan, back then, was in love 
with a boy named Naito-kun.</i>

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.400
Cops and robbers? You mean what 
we played when we were kids?

00:08:26.400 --> 00:08:27.900
That's right!

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.610
You're like elementary schoolers!

00:08:29.960 --> 00:08:30.780
Right?

00:08:30.780 --> 00:08:32.960
<i>Kou was there, too.</i>

00:08:31.230 --> 00:08:32.960
I wanna play, too!

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:34.830
What, seriously?

00:08:35.280 --> 00:08:36.820
Futaba, you guys, you play too!

00:08:39.100 --> 00:08:40.790
What? Cops and robbers?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.750
What, we're gonna play with girls?

00:08:44.000 --> 00:08:46.010
What should we do, Futaba?

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.430
I guess... we could play.

00:08:57.430 --> 00:08:59.640
Okay! It's settled!

00:08:59.640 --> 00:09:01.130
I'll count to a hundred!

00:09:01.130 --> 00:09:02.030
Start running!

00:09:02.030 --> 00:09:08.160
One... two... three... four...

00:09:04.190 --> 00:09:08.160
<i>My first year of middle school was peaceful.</i>

00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:16.300
<i>But in my second year...</i>

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:18.670
Hey, Yoshioka's not bad, huh?

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:20.740
Yeah, she's cute.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:22.660
She's so docile.

00:09:22.660 --> 00:09:26.010
Those other girls around her could 
learn some things from Yoshioka!

00:09:27.350 --> 00:09:33.170
<b>Science</b>

00:09:29.270 --> 00:09:32.640
<i>...things around me started to get noisy.</i>

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:36.720
Futaba sure does play 
nicey-nice around the boys.

00:09:36.720 --> 00:09:37.180
Yeah!

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:38.630
Makes me mad...

00:09:39.680 --> 00:09:40.580
Futaba.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:42.390
<i>At times like that...</i>

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:47.610
They're just jealous because 
you're popular with the boys!

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:52.360
That's not your fault, Futaba.
 They're so stupid.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:57.320
<i>...the only person who stayed 
by my side was Yumi-chan.</i>

00:09:57.320 --> 00:09:59.950
But I'm on your side, Futaba.

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:02.470
<i>But then, Yumi-chan...</i>

00:10:03.530 --> 00:10:06.900
<i>One day, she suddenly stopped talking to me.</i>

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.080
Wait a minute! I'm coming, too!

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:12.370
Oh, Yumi. Aren't you going 
to stay with Futaba?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.840
No... it's fine, it's fine.

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:22.770
<i>I never knew the reason why. 
I lost the last person who took my side.</i>

00:10:24.900 --> 00:10:28.100
We haven't seen each other 
since graduation, right?

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:30.230
Yeah.

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:38.040
Remember Naito?

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:41.870
The guy you liked?

00:10:42.470 --> 00:10:43.390
Yeah.

00:10:44.740 --> 00:10:48.500
I really asked you for a lot of advice 
back then, Futaba.

00:10:48.500 --> 00:10:50.230
Those were the days!

00:10:53.520 --> 00:10:56.510
Yeah... they sure were.

00:10:57.130 --> 00:11:00.720
<i>I'm lying. I can't think fondly 
back on those days.</i>

00:11:01.570 --> 00:11:04.330
<i>I just can't think of 
what else to say</i>

00:11:04.830 --> 00:11:09.200
<i>to the person who distanced herself 
from me without telling me why.</i>

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:10.730
Listen...

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:15.980
I've wanted to apologize 
to you for a while, Futaba.

00:11:18.750 --> 00:11:20.650
Back in those days,

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:24.940
I heard a rumor from the other girls 
that you liked Naito, too.

00:11:28.110 --> 00:11:32.120
And when I went to 
check with you about it...

00:11:33.570 --> 00:11:34.580
Futaba—

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:42.010
You were watching Naito...

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:48.710
In that moment, I was thinking, 
"But I liked him first!"

00:11:50.770 --> 00:11:55.050
Even though liking him first didn't 
make me any better. I knew that...

00:11:56.710 --> 00:12:02.950
I wasn't acting rationally back then.
 I was just really mad at you.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:10.150
Even though I knew that

00:12:10.150 --> 00:12:13.250
if I put distance between us, 
I'd be leaving you alone.

00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:13.670
I'm sor—

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.220
Yumi-chan, I...

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:20.460
I never liked Naito-kun... at all.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:21.680
What?

00:12:23.020 --> 00:12:26.890
Thinking back now, 
there was another guy I liked.

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.240
<i>Naito-kun was friends with Kou.</i>

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:34.570
<i>I kept wanting to ask him 
if there'd been any word from Kou,</i>

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:38.470
<i>if he knew anything about Kou...</i>

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:44.200
<i>Yumi-chan probably got 
the wrong idea from that.</i>

00:12:45.140 --> 00:12:48.420
Futaba... I'm sorry.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:50.560
It's okay.

00:12:51.580 --> 00:12:54.740
<i>Liking the same boy as your friend...</i>

00:12:57.730 --> 00:12:59.310
<i>Is this what it results in?</i>

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:06.090
Sorry. I'm going home, okay?

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:10.060
I'm glad I saw you today.

00:13:17.500 --> 00:13:20.210
<i>I was naive to think what I did.</i>

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:27.680
<i>I thought that Yuuri would 
definitely forgive me.</i>

00:13:27.680 --> 00:13:29.510
<i>Part of me was counting on that.</i>

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:40.750
<i>But like Yumi-chan... 
she'll just end up hating me.</i>

00:13:41.740 --> 00:13:46.130
Why'd I have to run into 
her at a time like this?

00:13:47.200 --> 00:13:51.100
<i>I feel like God is testing me, somehow.</i>

00:13:51.630 --> 00:13:56.020
<i>But I can't hide my love for Kou anymore.</i>

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:01.980
<i>So... I just have to tell her!</i>

00:14:03.380 --> 00:14:05.080
<i>I have to...</i>

00:14:10.230 --> 00:14:15.060
<i>It's been days since I decided I'd do it!
 Say it already, me!</i>

00:14:15.060 --> 00:14:17.350
Incompetent, incompetent, incompetent!

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.740
Morning!

00:14:19.110 --> 00:14:21.140
Futaba-chan! Morning!

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:22.930
Morning...

00:14:29.400 --> 00:14:30.330
Makita.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:33.850
I brought the CD I mentioned 
in my e-mail yesterday.

00:14:35.500 --> 00:14:36.980
Oh, thank you!

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:41.690
<i>Are they already exchanging e-mails?</i>

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.550
It's got a self-cover 
that hasn't been released yet.

00:14:45.440 --> 00:14:46.740
It's pretty great.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:48.820
Wow!

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:52.220
<i>Lucky Yuuri.</i>

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:52.220
What song do you recommend?

00:14:52.220 --> 00:14:56.410
<i>It's easy for her, since she's established 
herself as a "cute character."</i>

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:56.410
Personally, I recommend...

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:00.870
<i>What was that? 
That was mean jealousy!</i>

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.480
Oh?

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:12.540
<i>But... I understand Yuuri's feelings 
of wanting him to think she's cute...</i>

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:14.610
<i>I can see both sides.</i>

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:17.200
<i>What's with this feeling?!</i>

00:15:17.200 --> 00:15:18.190
Futaba-chan!

00:15:19.470 --> 00:15:21.690
Mabuchi-kun lent me a CD!

00:15:22.350 --> 00:15:23.900
That's great.

00:15:25.680 --> 00:15:27.320
Murao-san, good morning!

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.200
Morning.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.430
Hi, there.

00:15:34.560 --> 00:15:39.310
<i>Yuuri's just doing the best 
she can with what she's got.</i>

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:45.310
<i>I'm by far the worst one, 
for not admitting what I feel.</i>

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:52.820
Yoshioka.

00:15:56.420 --> 00:15:57.170
What? What?

00:15:57.170 --> 00:15:57.890
What is it?

00:15:58.500 --> 00:15:59.850
What do you mean?

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:01.810
<i>What is it?!</i>

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:07.230
The report we handed in before.

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:13.200
<b>Leadership Training Report 

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:10.950
The part that you wrote had way 
too many misspellings and stuff.

00:16:10.950 --> 00:16:13.200
They want you to fix it and hand it back in.

00:16:13.850 --> 00:16:18.160
Oh... roger that...

00:16:20.620 --> 00:16:22.540
Are you okay?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:37.180
I'm going to say it. I just have to say it.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:37.930
I'll say it!

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:43.020
<i>It's so hard to say...</i>

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:47.230
Futaba-chan, don't you have 
an appetite? Are you okay?

00:16:47.230 --> 00:16:50.580
I bought too much out of habit.

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:52.500
Yuuri, want a chocolate roll?

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.620
And anpan? And a yakisoba roll?

00:16:58.790 --> 00:17:00.420
I couldn't eat that much...

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:03.660
I guess not.

00:17:04.780 --> 00:17:07.110
Murao-san, want some bread?

00:17:07.110 --> 00:17:08.940
No, thank you.

00:17:08.940 --> 00:17:10.530
I guess not...

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.580
Maybe I'll return them.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:15.010
I don't think you can return bread.

00:17:15.710 --> 00:17:18.310
But I think I'll still try.

00:17:18.310 --> 00:17:19.260
Futaba-chan!

00:17:20.160 --> 00:17:20.880
What?

00:17:20.880 --> 00:17:22.360
You want some company?

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:24.540
No! I'll go by myself.

00:17:30.510 --> 00:17:31.860
I...

00:17:32.370 --> 00:17:37.420
I wonder if I've done something 
to offend Futaba-chan...

00:17:39.440 --> 00:17:42.410
I think I'll go with her, after all.

00:17:50.500 --> 00:17:53.460
Excuse me! Did a girl who 
bought bread come back here?

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:54.890
<i>I don't want to distance myself from Yuuri.</i>

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.640
<i>And I want to love Kou, too.</i>

00:18:00.320 --> 00:18:05.600
I guess it's too much to expect 
that I could have both, right?

00:18:06.330 --> 00:18:10.310
<i>After all, Kou doesn't even 
think of me as a girl.</i>

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:16.950
<i>So maybe I could not tell Yuuri, 
and care for Kou in secret?</i>

00:18:19.280 --> 00:18:21.240
Kou! What are you doing?

00:18:21.240 --> 00:18:22.160
You scared—

00:18:26.030 --> 00:18:26.850
Quiet.

00:18:26.850 --> 00:18:28.370
<i>So close! So close!
So close! So close!</i>

00:18:34.780 --> 00:18:35.880
Kou!

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.490
Not good, he's here.

00:18:37.490 --> 00:18:39.260
Tanaka-sensei?

00:18:39.260 --> 00:18:40.590
Where'd you get off to?

00:18:42.090 --> 00:18:43.070
Kou!

00:18:47.280 --> 00:18:49.770
Why are you running from Tanaka-sensei?

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:55.650
He won't stop bugging me 
about eating dinner with him.

00:18:57.290 --> 00:18:59.950
Why not eat some dinner with him, then?

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:10.950
<i>That's the silence that says, 
"Don't ask any more about that."</i>

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.880
Did you change your shampoo?

00:19:21.040 --> 00:19:23.850
I wanted to be attractive to you...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.230
Yeah... you were right.

00:19:33.640 --> 00:19:39.320
You really do have to say it in a way 
that makes it clear you're joking.

00:19:40.690 --> 00:19:43.230
Okay. My brother's gone.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.180
I'm going.

00:19:46.280 --> 00:19:49.090
<i>What nonsense.
 "Care for him in secret"?</i>

00:19:49.090 --> 00:19:52.370
<i>I still want things 
to work out if they can.</i>

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:57.070
<i>Doing things like changing 
my shampoo just so he'll like it.</i>

00:19:57.070 --> 00:20:00.840
<i>It's petty to do that kind of thing
 without telling Yuuri.</i>

00:20:02.910 --> 00:20:04.050
Oh, that's right.

00:20:04.640 --> 00:20:06.700
Makita was looking for you.

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:10.780
She seemed really worried.

00:20:10.780 --> 00:20:12.010
Did something happen with you guys?

00:20:15.120 --> 00:20:18.440
<i>Yuuri is... worried?</i>

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:22.400
<i>Well, you know.</i>

00:20:23.700 --> 00:20:26.090
<i>That's the kind of girl Yuuri is.</i>

00:20:27.290 --> 00:20:30.910
<i>I know what a good person she is.</i>

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:38.290
<i>And what a precious, 
precious friend she is to me.</i>

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:44.220
When you talked to me the first time, 
do you know how happy it made me?

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:46.720
That's why...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:51.270
I'll never leave you 
by yourself, Futaba-chan.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:58.340
<i>That's why I don't want to distance myself.</i>

00:21:02.300 --> 00:21:05.880
<i>But the fact that she's 
so precious to me</i>

00:21:05.880 --> 00:21:08.520
<i>is all the more reason 
I have to tell her, right?</i>

00:21:08.520 --> 00:21:14.400
<i>Then Yuuri can be the one to decide 
to put distance between us or not.</i>

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:29.990
Futaba-chan!

00:21:31.640 --> 00:21:35.620
The donuts at the shop in front of 
the station are 100 yen now, right?

00:21:36.780 --> 00:21:38.770
Want to stop by there with me today?

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:40.880
Yuuri...

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:47.340
Yeah.

00:21:47.340 --> 00:21:51.710
<i>Today, I might...</i>

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.900
<i>...lose a precious friend.</i>

00:23:25.920 --> 00:23:40.940
Next Episode . . .

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:34.140
Even if things go better for one of you,
 I'll always remain neutral, so...

00:23:35.460 --> 00:23:37.890
Go for it, both of you.
